# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/full_game.lua. fullgame_probe.lua joins as player 1
# with two start presses, which buy one quarter, and plays on. Without the script every game
# ends after the first quarter (measured on all five games: "game over in quarter 1"); with it
# the game runs all four quarters with no buy-in screen. It writes qtr_purchased = 4 for each
# joined player, and the game's own monitor_fullgame then treats the game as bought.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/full_game.lua
extra fullgame_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbamht nbahangt
frames 45001
once quarter 2 starts
once quarter 3 starts
once quarter 4 starts
once game over in quarter 4
nolog game over in quarter 1
